    <briefdescription>
<para>RAII claim on one component type, for the tracker to see. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Movable and default-constructible so a view can keep an array of them, one per component type it names, without knowing the count until instantiation. A moved-from or default-constructed scope releases nothing. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
